ount":5,"retweet_count":1},"text":"A股科技牛群友们太厉害了，在AI短剧里各种爽吃！ https://t.co/8mIEwFZxYI","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2109499210349642023"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2109491212470436301","created_at":"2026-10-12T03:47:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109491212470436301"],"id":"2109491212470436301","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":25798,"like_count":33,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109484072380875226","type":"quoted"}],"text":"A股科技牛群的课代表们，吊打推上一众A股大V！ https://t.co/gpJwEEFeuB https://t.co/Lxjcn9zHnU","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2109491212470436301"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2109484072380875226","created_at":"2026-10-12T03:19:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109484072380875226"],"id":"2109484072380875226","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":39777,"like_count":29,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":2},"text":"开盘一早定调的短剧最强哈，那么为什么短剧里出版和影视涨的最好，答对的有奖哦！ https://t.co/KUWbCitG1J","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2109484072380875226"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2109288074962428333","created_at":"2026-10-11T14:20:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109288074962428333"],"id":"2109288074962428333","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":35,"impression_count":10237,"like_count":37,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":1},"text":"让女人沦陷的第二种抚摸，跟肢体欲望无关\n \n很多人误以为，能打动女人的肢体接触，一定和欲望挂钩。可现实恰恰相反，真正让女人卸下防备的第二种抚摸，追求的从不是肉体上的亲密，而是情绪层面的治愈。\n \n第一种抚摸，源于本能冲动，目的性很强，一心想要推进关系。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2109288074962428333"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2109257294114619431","created_at":"2026-10-11T12:18:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109257294114619431"],"id":"2109257294114619431","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":3187,"like_count":26,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":3},"text":"现实里被市场教育了无数次后，我只信两样东西： “概率”和“仓位管理”。\n以前当Sub的时候，亏一次就怀疑人生，赢一次就觉得自己是神。\n后来悟了——先掌控自己的决策系统，再谈掌控仓位。\n交易是欲望的复利。 你每天做的每一个决定，都在给未来的自己加杠杆，或者减杠杆。\n今天你做了什么？ https://t.co/PoN6dX0eX0","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2109257294114619431"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2109135184348209611","created_at":"2026-10-11T04:13:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109135184348209611"],"id":"2109135184348209611","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":3458,"like_count":17,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":1},"text":"交易俱乐部第一条规则：\n永远不要用情绪当保证金。\n情绪是Sub的燃料，执行力才是Dom的武器。\n今天只做一件事： 打开笔记，写下你自己的三条铁律。 写不出来的人，说明你的规则已经被市场写好了。\n写完的扣1。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2109135184348209611"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2109115825039048825","created_at":"2026-10-11T02:56:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109115825039048825"],"id":"2109115825039048825","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2892,"like_count":19,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2100428499316273577","type":"quoted"}],"text":"我发情感其实是在育人，在中国的传统教育下，是缺失这一环的，很多人都不是完整的人，甚至不能称之为人。\n没有完整的人格是很难做好交易的！ https://t.co/XobZrdpDJf","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2109115825039048825"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2109113321601544477","created_at":"2026-10-11T02:46:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109113321601544477"],"id":"2109113321601544477","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":2512,"like_count":20,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":2},"text":"三位新科诺奖得主，年轻时都没走\"正路\"：一个想当作家，一个想当航海家，一个毕业后先去当了中学老师。\n\n允许走弯路，本身就是一种教育水平。好的教育，不是把所有人都赶上同一条赛道，而是允许一个人先去搞清楚自己是谁、想为这个世界留下点什么。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2109113321601544477"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2109094500392144905","created_at":"2026-10-11T01:31:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109094500392144905"],"id":"2109094500392144905","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":3672,"like_count":30,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我摊牌了。\n投资是一场大型群体BDSM。\n大多数人一进场就默认当Sub——被行情牵着走，被情绪反复调教，亏了还说“这是交学费”。\n真正的Dom先定规则，再上场。\n数学告诉我概率，执行力告诉我能不能活下来。\n今天开始，我只跟想从Sub升级成Dom的人说话。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2109094500392144905"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2108961389557752144","created_at":"2026-10-10T16:42:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108961389557752144"],"id":"2108961389557752144","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":2789,"like_count":22,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":2},"text":"一切关系皆为权力关系。不要问这段关系有没有博弈，要问谁在博弈中占上风，靠的是什么。人在每一段关系中争夺的东西无非几样：谁的需求先被满足，谁的话被听见，谁承担代价，谁的底线被尊重，谁有权先走，谁有权定义性质，谁有权定规矩。这七样没有一样是天然归属某人，归属只由一件事决定：","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2108961389557752144"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2108944508151083125","created_at":"2026-10-10T15:35:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108944508151083125"],"id":"2108944508151083125","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":324,"impression_count":49535,"like_count":662,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":77},"text":"女人为什么总喜欢坏男人？坏男人能帮女人卸下羞耻感，女人没法主动丢掉羞耻感，会有道德底线压着，有社交舆论盯着，她一旦主动跨出那一步，就是堕落，要受千夫所指。而坏男人做的，就是帮她把欲望从道德里剥出来，让她可以只管享受，又不用自责。她不是被坏男人骗了，而是坏男人帮她做了自己不敢做的事","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2108944508151083125"}],"errors":[{"detail":"Could not find tweet with referenced_tweets.id: [2109569352366522766].","parameter":"referenced_tweets.id","resource_id":"2109569352366522766","resource_type":"tweet","title":"Not Found Error","type":"https://api.x.com/2/problems/resource-not-found","value":"2109569352366522766"}],"includes":{"tweets":[{"author_id":"4817349014","conversation_id":"2109569403318939754","created_at":"2026-10-12T09:47:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109581720131703289"],"id":"2109581720131703289","in_reply_to_user_id":"928496628570427392","l